803	827	Life cycle, Childhood	Sexual Expression in Adolescent Boys	Ordinal	Encouragement of sexual behavior, taking into account its frequency, emotional intensity, importance, and variety (including range of partners) in adolescence. Heterosexual intercourse is the principal criterion, but heterosexual foreplay, masturbation, homosexuality, sexual jokes, and exposing the genitals were also considered.	Barry, H., & Schlegel, A. (1984). Measurements of adolescent sexual behavior in the standard sample of societies. Ethnology, 23(4), 315-329.	barry1984measurements
